$HG = \sqrt{O'G^{2} - O'H^{2}} = \sqrt{\left(\dfrac{R}{\sqrt{3}}\right)^{2} - \left(\dfrac{R}{2}\right)^{2} } = \dfrac{R\sqrt{3} }{6}$.\\
Suy ra\\
$TG = TH + HG = \dfrac{R\sqrt{3}}{2} + \dfrac{R\sqrt{3}}{6} = \dfrac{2R\sqrt{3}}{3}$.\\
Diện tích $\triangle {TMG}$ là\\
$S = \dfrac{1}{2} \cdot TG \cdot MH = \dfrac{1}{2} \cdot \dfrac{3R}{2} \cdot \dfrac{2R\sqrt{3}}{3} = \dfrac{R^{2}\sqrt{3}}{2}$.
}\end{ex}

